      "message": "Set if the two immediatly preceding calls to cond_set were\n\n  cond_set_true()\n  cond_set_false()\n\nIt will NOT return true if\n\n  cond_set_true()\n  cond_set_false()\n  cond_set_false()\n\nThat is, if you have two tasks:\n\n  task1 {\n    cond_set(\u0026c, gpio_get_level(something);\n    sleep(100000);\n  }\n\n  task2 {\n    if (cond_went_true(\u0026c)\n       ccprintf(\"HEY!\\n\");\n    sleep(500000);\n  }\n\nThen you\u0027ll miss edges.",
